Z||000028||artherd||09-05-2001||04:55 AM||||Hrm, I'm all of twenty years old, and male.  And while it's planatively irrelivant as to wether I am offended by the comparison between a woman's Vagina, and a Honda Civic (sounds funny when phrased properly, and I am for the record, rather greatly offended  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>The fact remains that your use of language and tact reflects on the type of person you are.<P>I myself try to act with the same kindness and compassion I would like others to show me.<P>If this means "showing my age" so be it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>PS: Archie's way is probally best, grin!<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
