Z||000035||Cliff Pennock||09-05-2001||02:20 PM||||Ok, have to throw in my 2c here. A <B>lot</B> of the stuff I read here I find offensive. Perhaps not personally, but because of the lack of respect it shows. This indeed has <B>nothing</B> to do with age. If you post stuff of which you <B>know</B> will be found offensive by a good deal of people, then you are in my opinion a mindless and respectless sob, because you are then offending people <B>by choice</B> and not <B>by accident</B>.<P>In such case, you are not a <B>hair</B> better than those people that key cars for instance, because you couldn't care less that it upsets other people.<P>I see it as a character flaw. Most people on the forum that post offensive stuff are the same people that feel they need to jump in at <B>every single flamewar</B>. They thrive on controversy, and seek trouble wherever it can be found.<P>Anyway, that's my <B>personal</B> opinion. It has nothing to do with the way I moderate this forum.||||reg||1
