Z||000043||Formula88||09-05-2001||08:41 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by JohnnyK:<BR><B>So you guys wouldn't help someone because you don't "like" them? Thats pretty immature wouldn't you say? Plus, you have never even met the people. There are a few people I hate here, but I'm sure if I met them in real life, I would get along great with them. I just think that is childish that you wouldn't help someone with their problem because you dislike them. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>So are there people in real life that you dislike?  If they called you on the phone asking for help, would you give it?  Personally, I wouldn't.  Respect is a 2-way street.  If people expect it, they have to show it to others.  Just becaue I'm on the Forum, and because someone else is on the Forum doesn't mean I'm obligated to help them.  There have been people on this forum who've really helped me a lot when I needed it.  And these same people, I will bend over backwards to help, anytime I can.  Someone who shows no respect for themself or others, I could care less if they get the help they need.<BR>||||reg||13
Z||000044||Formula88||09-05-2001||08:46 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Archie:<BR><B>Ok kiddies, take some shots at me..... see if you can insult me before you embarrass yourself.<P>Archie</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Archie, you are an opinionated S.O.B.  Now, before you think I'm trying to insult you, let me say that I have an enormous amount of respect for you.  You have your point of view, and you stick to it.  I've never seen you waver from your ideals in your postings, even when it may upset others.  I can disagree with you if I like (I usually don't) but that doesn't mean one of us is wrong - we just have different points of view.  I agree with you completely on this point of respect.  <P>Sign me, a fellow opinionated S.O.B. !||||reg||14
Z||000045||DRH||09-05-2001||09:07 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by JohnnyK:<BR><B>So you guys wouldn't help someone because you don't "like" them? Thats pretty immature wouldn't you say? Plus, you have never even met the people. There are a few people I hate here, but I'm sure if I met them in real life, I would get along great with them. I just think that is childish that you wouldn't help someone with their problem because you dislike them. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>So you'd help out that manager that hassled you out of the bar if you saw him on the side of the road? I doubt it... He was rude to you and your friends. You don't see any parallel? <P>We might very well get along fine in the real world. The only world I know you in right now though is this one. And the only opinion I can have of you right now is based on how you act here. I sure don't hate you or anybody else on here though. There are just some people I would go out of my way for, and some I wouldn't... Same as in real life.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000046||Jaygee79||09-05-2001||11:27 PM||||I've never said anything about being offended before because honestly I've never really seen anything that I find offensive.  I don't go into the tech or mall sections much, so there's a lot I don't see.  What I did find offensive here, though, is Sleeper's signature.  I don't know if he created it just for the occasion or if that is his regular sig.  There was also someone else who posted some pictures on the forum (I won't mention any names here.  if you think its you, ask me and i'll let you know) that had nothing to do with me, but I still found rather offensive.<P>if someone posts something just out of fun, not realizing that it offends someone, that's one thing.  but if they know it is offensive and don't care, then those are the ones who can kiss my patooty.<P>(btw, sorry if that was offensive to anyone    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)<p>[This message has been edited by Jaygee79 (edited 09-05-2001).]||||reg||1
